    "description": "The building of Worlds End Studios started life as a factory manufacturing machines for commercial baking ovens; it burned down and the remains were used as the foundations of what we know today.\r\nTwo young architects found the ruined site in 1974. They wanted to create a community workspace geared toward designers, one of the first of its kind, in London.",
